    LLM: 'Collect pieces that sum to 9 or pair; discard pieces that do not help form Gou or Doi.\n\nTrack which values have been discarded; in easy variant use both Gou and Doi; in hard variant focus on identical pairs or value-2.\n\nOptimise draw choice (discard vs table) to complete three sets before opponents; block by taking useful discards.',
